      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01184",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“太不好了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "This is awful.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01184",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "我心里难受，你还是回去吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "It makes me miserable; you should go home.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01184",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "我已经没什么新衣服可穿了。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I do not have any new clothes left to wear.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01184",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "每次到你这儿来，总想换一件赴宴服，全部衣服都穿过了，身上这件还是朋友的呢。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Every time I come here to see you, I want to change into a different outfit for entertaining, but I have worn all my clothes already, and even this one I am wearing is borrowed from a friend.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p01184",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "我这个人真坏，是吗？”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I am a terrible person, aren't I?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
